80%e5%8f%aa%e6%89%8b%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b.assets/640.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>那些小故事</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>巧合</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%B7%A7%E5%90%88/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 28 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%B7%A7%E5%90%88/</guid><description>每周六是我们多伦多普贤佛教中心的聚会时间，善德法师常来开示。法师远近闻名，是一位真正实修实证的善知识。 中午是大家期盼已久的素食大餐，皆来自各</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%b7%a7%e5%90%88.assets/image-20250128101321463.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>那些小故事</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>开过光的嘴</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%BC%80%E8%BF%87%E5%85%89%E7%9A%84%E5%98%B4/</link><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 24 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%BC%80%E8%BF%87%E5%85%89%E7%9A%84%E5%98%B4/</guid><description>前几天在杨医生的医馆和几位义工聊天，大家都说杨医生好厉害，什么都知道。 我突然想到几年前，跟随杨医生去义诊的时候发生的一个小插曲： 那年杨医生忙</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%bc%80%e8%bf%87%e5%85%89%e7%9a%84%e5%98%b4.assets/image-20250128092848529.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>那些小故事</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item></channel></rss>